  map_mul' := by aesop
  map_zero' := by simp

Depends on / 依赖: Classical, Classical.decPred, DecidablePred, Units.mk0, WithZero, WithZero.coe_one, coe_one, decPred, map_mul, map_one, map_zero, mem_valueGroup, valueGroup
